      "alt": "TQMa8Mx board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX8M with extended audio and video functions.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa8Mx Embedded Module offers a versatile solution for embedded computing engineers. Based on the i.MX8M processor, it features Cortex-A53 cores, enhanced audio and video functions, and support for 4K graphics with VP9/4K HDR10. This module is equipped with a powerful 1x Cortex-M4 CPU for real-time and security tasks, and it's designed for low power consumption. High-speed communication is facilitated through 1x Gbit Ethernet, 2x PCIe, and 2x USB 3.0 interfaces, making it suitable for a wide range of applications.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:18:01 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
