     "table_container_copy_558282354": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td width=\"20%\" style=\"width:152px;\"><b>TQMa8MD-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>TQMa8MD-AA, i.MX8M Dual Cortex®-A53/1,3 GHz, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 1 GB LPDDR4, 64 kB EEPROM, RTC, -25°C…+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:152px;\"><p><b>TQMa8MQ-AA</b></p>\n</td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>TQMa8MQ-AA, i.MX8M Quad Cortex®-A53/1,3 GHz, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 1 GB LPDDR4, 64 kB EEPROM, RTC, -25°C…+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:152px;\"><b>TQMa8MQL-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>TQMa8MQL-AA, i.MX8M Quad Lite Cortex®-A53/1,3 GHz, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 2 GB LPDDR4, 64 kB EEPROM, RTC, -25°C…+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:152px;\"><b>STKa8Mx-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>.STKa8Mx (Eval Kit) with TQMa8Mx-AA, i.MX8M/1,3 GHz, 1 GB LPDDR4, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 64 kB EEPROM, RTC, 2x USB 3.0 Host, 1x USB 2.0 OTG, 1x ETH 10/100/1000, 1x ePD, 1x LVDS/DSI, 1xHDMI, 2x MIPI CSI, 1x Mini PCIe + SIM, Module Signals on 2,54 mm PIN Header, Sound, RTC, Temperature sensor, Reset-Button, SD Card interface, Power Supply, 4 GB SD card, Cables</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td width=\"25%\" style=\"width:152px;\"><b>Starterkit STKa8Mx set</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>The core of the STKa8Mx set is the TQMa8Mx module with a Dual/Quad Cortex®-A53 CPU. The components contained in the starter kit constitute a modular system enabling you to develop your own product ideas. Development of graphic interfaces can be started immediately using the prepared combination of closed display unit and starter kit that are matched to each other. To develop your own hardware you can use the certified and qualified circuit components of the starter kit in your own designs.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:18:24 GMT+0000",
